============================================================
Step 5: Physical interpretation of generators
============================================================
  Each generator is a direction in log-Pi space along which the
  pore fraction is preserved: simultaneously rescaling the
  dimensionless groups along g keeps the LPBF physics invariant.

  Generator 1:
    Pi1 x exp(-0.485*eps), Pi3 x exp(+0.767*eps), Pi5 x exp(+0.078*eps), Pe_vap x exp(-0.187*eps), Pr x exp(+0.367*eps)
    Meaning: increase Pi3 while decrease Pi1, increase Pi5, decrease Pe_vap, increase Pr
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 2:
    Pi2 x exp(+0.321*eps), Pi4 x exp(+0.937*eps), Pi5 x exp(-0.064*eps), Pi6 x exp(+0.063*eps), Pe_vap x exp(-0.067*eps), Pr x exp(+0.076*eps)
    Meaning: increase Pi4 while increase Pi2, decrease Pi5, increase Pi6, decrease Pe_vap, increase Pr
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 3:
    Pi1 x exp(+0.233*eps), Pi2 x exp(+0.336*eps), Pi3 x exp(+0.087*eps), Pi4 x exp(-0.060*eps), Pi5 x exp(+0.901*eps), Pi6 x exp(+0.069*eps), Pr x exp(-0.068*eps)
    Meaning: increase Pi5 while increase Pi1, increase Pi2, increase Pi3, decrease Pi4, increase Pi6, decrease Pr
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 4:
    Pi1 x exp(-0.083*eps), Pi2 x exp(-0.320*eps), Pi4 x exp(+0.062*eps), Pi5 x exp(+0.072*eps), Pi6 x exp(+0.937*eps)
    Meaning: increase Pi6 while decrease Pi1, decrease Pi2, increase Pi4, increase Pi5
             to keep Pi (and pore fraction) unchanged

  Generator 5:
    Pi1 x exp(-0.324*eps), Pi2 x exp(+0.317*eps), Pi3 x exp(-0.178*eps), Pi4 x exp(-0.073*eps), Pi6 x exp(+0.055*eps), Pe_vap x exp(+0.797*eps), Pr x exp(+0.345*eps)
